[34.131,"o","Goal: `add(a, b)` returns the sum; acceptance: a regression test passes.\r\n1. In `app.js`, change `add()` from `return a - b;` to `return a + b;`, preserving `module.exports = { add }`.\r\n2. Create `app.test.js` using `node:test` and `node:assert/strict`; require `./app` and assert `add(2, 3) === 5`.\r\n3. Verify the test fails before the fix (actual `-1`), then passes afterward: `node --test app.test.js`.\r\nRisk/open question: only `app.js` exists; no test setup or Node version is declared. Confirm Node supports `node:test`.\r\n\r\n---\r\njob_id: job-261022032522-f069\r\nsession_id: 01a161a4-66ee-7280-922c-292c5d7f2091 (pass as session_id to continue this Codex thread)\r\nmodel: codex default, effort: low\r\n"]
